{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118232","id":3491033364,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QFPEU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118232","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118232.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118232.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118232","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118232/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118232/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118232/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/039d474aa761a26f2b7d58474375ee855caae312","number":118232,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add tests for Container nodes","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Edit: Part of #43440 \r\n\r\nAs part of my work on #116640, I kept breaking existing `Container` node behaviors silently due to a lack of test coverage. \r\nThis PR adds (what should be) thorough test coverage for the following nodes:\r\n* `AspectRatioContainer`\r\n* `BoxContainer`\r\n* `CenterContainer`\r\n* `FlowContainer`\r\n* `FoldableContainer`\r\n* `GridContainer`\r\n* `MarginContainer`\r\n* `PanelContainer`\r\n* `ScrollContainer`\r\n\r\nThe following types already had extensive test coverage and were thus left as-is:\r\n* `SplitContainer`\r\n* `TabContainer`\r\n\r\nThe only remaining `Container` types that do not have proper coverage (because I was not confident in adding tests for those here and don't really need to for my PR) are as follows:\r\n* `GraphElement`\r\n  * `GraphFrame`\r\n  * `GraphNode`\r\n* `SubViewportContainer`\r\n\r\n*AI disclaimer: GPT 5.3 Codex, high-effort, was used to put together this PR. I manually implemented the first 3 (alphabetically), then had it copy that style for the other 6. Half of `ScrollContainer` is also ported over from my maxsize PR. A second AI was then used to adversarially review the changes, and its recommendations were applied. Everything was then checked by hand, and all tests were run locally.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","desc